{"id":"wb-6-859","name":"牛角寨石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"牛角寨石窟","text":"牛角寨石窟位于四川省仁寿县高家镇鹰头村，分布于牛角寨、坛神岩两个相对独立的区域，开凿集中于唐代，其中牛角寨区共计40龛，坛神岩区共计71龛。此外，在玉皇顶（鹰头嘴近顶处）还有一龛清代摩崖造像。\n1991年4月16日公布为四川省第三批文物保护单位。2006年5月25日列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%89%9B%E8%A7%92%E5%AF%A8%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F","revisionId":92932897,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92932897","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/abcc4afd227bb2e9e682e426.jpg","title":"牛角寨石窟照片.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%89%9B%E8%A7%92%E5%AF%A8%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/49/%E7%89%9B%E8%A7%92%E5%AF%A8%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Niujiao village grottoes","width":320,"height":253}}